{{Term/Store|Flamebreaker Helm|Flamebreaker Helms|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
Flamebreaker Helms are pieces of [[Armor]] that can be purchased in the [[Ripped and Shredded]] shop at [[Goron City]]. When worn, they provide one level of [[Flame Guard]]. Flamebreaker Helms can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] and can be [[Dye|Hateno Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. The Flamebreaker Helm, alongside the [[Flamebreaker Armor]] and [[Flamebreaker Boots]], compose the [[Fireproof Armor]]. When each piece of the Set has been enhanced at least two times by a Great Fairy and the full Set is worn, it provides a [[Fireproof]] [[Set Bonus]].

